From 40b57f02231ef9ecd4fe71cf61f36d6f8a7f5ffe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fast_sync: add 256-shard UTXO fast sync, P2P shard swarm, and
 live pivot activation

Add the 256-shard Sparse Merkle Tree UTXO fast-sync protocol
(GETUTXOROOTS, UTXOROOTS, GETUTXOSHARD, UTXOSHARD), interior branch
verification, autonomous multi-peer P2P shard download swarm,
ImportV2FastSyncPivotState live chainstate activation, and unit tests in
fast_sync_shard_tests.cpp and v2_protocol_handler_tests.cpp.
